From abda4f27ff150bc7ae4a8e7cc27daf528ae60e7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:17:18 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 288/398] Unified: tool names in the words of the terminology
 table
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The stock Japanese names left in the tool strip, the sketch's band, the bar
next to the picks and the tool search follow the table (Wording.py, written
into UnifiedWording_ja.ts by freecad-ja-unified's tools/apply_wording.py):
押し出す・切り抜く・回す・鏡に映す・まっすぐ並べる・円に並べる・動かす・測る、
円（中心から）・長方形・平行・点をつなぐ・はみ出しを切る、書き出す・読み込む…
with tooltips that say what happens. The old names stay as search aliases.
Translations of the history line, the panels and the words of picks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
